    "testimonials_raVC6": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "reviews_P8EzL": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1716192116__33__huge_0b48bac7-740d-4cb7-8f9c-be8b2060a468.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>My husband and I just did our gender reveal using GRI products and we were absolutely blown away! The quality of the products was exceptional and exceeded our expectations. We used the bio confetti cannon and the mega powder blaster. I was particularly impressed that the confetti was biodegradable - no clean up! And the powder blaster lasted for ages, which meant we were able to get some great photos to share with family abroad. Thanks so much for making this moment for us so special!<\/p>",
            "name": "Bonita Mills"
          }
        },
        "reviews_J89tQ": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1716191778__28__huge_32d515e8-2f6b-4606-8956-11e4943a6f18.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>I absolutely loved their customer service as I was in regular touch via email and they were so fast in replying to emails. They knew that I was the mom-to-be so were very mindful not to disclose the gender to me and communicated with my friend constantly. I also received discounts on the Mega Blasters as the mini ones were sold out. Thank you so much for making our gender reveal so wonderful!!!<\/p>",
            "name": "Binisha Gautam"
          }
        },
        "reviews_wgw7a": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1720304859__img_4277__huge.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>Great service! Kent was nice enough to deliver these to our place which was amazing.<\/p><p>Communication was clear which made it easier to collect.<\/p><p>Gender reveal with our smoke poppers and fire extinguishers were bloody awesome!!<\/p><p>Thank you again for making this so special, we had a blast with everyone even though it was raining hahahaha! 😊<\/p>",
            "name": "Storm Seppala"
          }
        },
        "reviews_rHkeq": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1721796846__img_7975__huge.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>If you are looking for an amazing gender reveal this is the place…Thankyou for making our day so special! Josh was so helpful with helping us choose the right product for our reveal! With our two little boys… He knew his products, and the quality and experience was 10\/10. Product itself was amazing! We were surprised with a girl and the pink extinguishers and cannnon popper, was so bright, colourful and made it extremely special! Thankyou again<\/p>",
            "name": "Alexandra Russell"
          }
        },
        "reviews_amX9t": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1728548330__screenshot_20241010_181656_facebook__huge.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>4 months ago We purchased a few Bio cannons along with a few other products for our special day. They’re so simple to use and give a burst of excitement and colour to our already exciting reveal. Purchasing and customer service was a pleasant and hassle free experience. Very satisfied!<\/p>",
            "name": "Matilda S."
          }
        },
        "reviews_p8QFA": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1729843838__screenshot2024-10-25181015__huge.png",
            "review_content": "<p>I recently purchased a cannon for a gender reveal from Gender Reveal Ideas and I couldn't be happier with my experience! The delivery was incredibly fast, and the quality of the product exceeded my expectations. The cannon worked perfectly, adding excitement to our special day. I highly recommend for anyone looking to make their gender reveal unforgettable!<\/p>",
            "name": "Igor Valente"
          }
        },
        "reviews_TPUwz": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1736741274__img_4861__huge.jpg",
            "review_content": "<p>Purchased a few products and everything went really smooth. From order to delivery. I had to also get in touch with the owner to find out about a few questions I had and nothing was too much trouble. After chatting for a bit about other things I uncovered the guy even had a salami hook up and he personally delivered some to me!! Absolute legend!!! If you need gender reveal products or even a salami hook up….. these guys are your people!!!<\/p>",
            "name": "Mikel Ramirez"
          }
        },
        "reviews_MRKKB": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2025-02-03_at_10.59.51_AM.png",
            "review_content": "<p>You know some business's give you that feel good experience, that is what you get when you shop here.<br\/>With endless questions from both myself and my daughter I felt for sure we would be on the ''Do no answer'' list lol<br\/>Honestly do not buy elsewhere.<br\/>I do really recommend the smoke bomb or cannon it goes for over a min, if you want smoke to last for photos.  My daughter had the glitter smoke which was great for her.<\/p>",
            "name": "Shelly Ives"
          }
        },
        "reviews_dk4fg": {
